<h1>Privacy policy (summary)</h1>

<p>Paceframe Coaching respects your privacy. This page is a short summary of how we handle personal data collected through this website.</p>

<h2>Contact form</h2>
<p>We use the contact form to respond to your enquiry. The form collects only the information you provide (name, email, phone, location, age, running experience, weekly mileage, goal, preferred contact method, availability). Submissions are emailed to kevmain@gmail.com and are not published.</p>

<h2>Lawful basis & consent</h2>
<p>We process your personal data to respond to your enquiry and to provide coaching services if you engage us. The contact form includes an explicit consent checkbox and links to this Privacy page.</p>

<h2>Retention</h2>
<p>By default we retain contact enquiries for up to 12 months unless you ask us to delete them earlier.</p>

<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You can request access, correction or deletion of your data by emailing kevmain@gmail.com.</p>

<p>This is a short summary for the initial website launch. A fuller privacy policy should be provided before wide public promotion.</p>
